@host = http://localhost:5080
# @host = https://YOUR-APP.azurewebsites.net

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Voter",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Login (copy the token into @token below)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@elections.ca",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

###
@token = PASTE-TOKEN-HERE

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Municipalities
GET {{host}}/api/municipalities

### Municipality 3 with its positions
GET {{host}}/api/municipalities/3

### Positions (optionally ?municipalityId=1)
GET {{host}}/api/positions

### Position 1
GET {{host}}/api/positions/1

### Candidates (optional filters: municipalityId, positionId, name)
GET {{host}}/api/candidates?municipalityId=3

### Candidate 1
GET {{host}}/api/candidates/1

### Search
GET {{host}}/api/candidates/search?name=chen

### My voting guide
GET {{host}}/api/savedcandidates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save a candidate
POST {{host}}/api/savedcandidates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "candidateId": 13 }

### Remove by savedCandidateId
DELETE {{host}}/api/savedcandidates/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
